{"id":776568,"title":"10｜案例1：如何微调一个英语口语练习大模型？","content":"本文介绍了如何利用百度智能云千帆Model Builder平台微调一个口语练习大模型，以提高在线英语教育的效率和降低成本。首先概述了环境准备步骤，包括安装依赖包和配置API密钥。接着分析了直接使用大模型进行口语练习时遇到的问题，如输出格式不规范、角色混淆及无法纠正语法错误等，并提出通过数据微调解决这些问题的方法。详细说明了数据准备过程，包括收集原始数据、扩充话题多样性以及生成各种类型的对话样本（如简略回答、跑题回复等）。在完成数据清洗后，选择Ernie Speed作为基础模型进行全量更新微调，并展示了实验结果表明此方法优于LoRA。最后，演示了如何发布和部署微调后的模型，并通过对比测试证明其在遵循指令、回复质量等方面优于未微调版本，同时具有更低的成本与时延。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":398541,"user_name":"林小正","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1068820,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"B314519CE8E35F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/10/4f/14/491d053a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1741613474,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":144587,"content":"https:&#47;&#47;time.geekbang.org&#47;course&#47;intro&#47;100768101 课程介绍里有课程资料包下载链接～","user_name":"编辑回复","user_name_real":"编辑","uid":1501385,"ctime":1741657722,"ip_address":"北京","comment_id":398541,"utype":2}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100768101,"comment_content":"代码在哪下载","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1501385,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/16/e8/c9/59bcd490.jpg","nickname":"听水的湖","note":"","ucode":"B1759F90165D81","race_medal":0,"user_type":8,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":658329,"discussion_content":"https://time.geekbang.org/course/intro/100768101 课程介绍里有课程资料包下载链接～","content_length":65,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1741657722,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"北京","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":8,\"source\":0}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":392850,"user_name":"秋晨","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1247845,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"5F2002818159D6",